    "title": "Conversation lifecycle tools and a smarter chat composer",
    "intro": "Today's nightly is a heavy sessions release: conversations gain archive, rename, pin, and snooze controls end-to-end, the chat composer learns to save drafts and stash prompts, and agents get first-class tools to spin up projects and hand off work. A preview routing fix also keeps local workspaces from being pushed through the remote tunnel.",
    "entries": [
